The [[Thornbloom]] is a [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Thorn Whip]] with a [[Heroic Potion]]. It is better in every way when compared with the [[Thorn Whip]], dealing more base damage and attacking slightly faster, while retaining the [[Thorn Whip]]'s {{icon/spikes}} scaling and {{icon/spikes}} gain on hit. Additionally, the [[Thornbloom]] has {{icon/empower}}-related abilities, having a chance to gain an {{icon/empower}} on hit, and giving the player some maximum health whenever {{icon/empower}} is gained from any source.

Overall, the [[Thornbloom]] is an excellent choice for the main weapon of a {{icon/spikes}} or {{icon/empower}} build. There are many class neutral options for {{icon/spikes}} gain, including [[Spiked Shield]], [[Pineapple]], [[Djinn Lamp]], and, should [[Furcifer]] bless you, [[Thorn Elemental]]. [[Ranger]] and [[Mage]] have the best class options for gaining lots of {{icon/spikes}}. {{icon/empower}} gain is somewhat more difficult, but is most easily done by [[Ranger]], [[Berserker]], and [[Mage]].
